Package: kcalc
Version: @DEB_KCALC_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.kde.org/kcalc/
Depends: qt6-base, kf6-config, kf6-configwidgets, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-crash, kf6-guiaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-notifications, kf6-xmlgui, libgmp10, libmpfr6
Description: KCalc scientific calculator (Qt6/KF6)
 KDE's calculator, with the GMP/MPFR-backed knumber arithmetic core. Simple,
 scientific, statistical and numeral-system modes are all built; only the
 docbook handbook is omitted.
